sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Caller process
    participant S as Server process
    participant D as Database
    participant W as Worker process
    participant P as Provider
    A->>S: Create with stable key
    S->>D: Commit inbox and delivery rows
    D-->>S: Commit confirmed
    S-->>A: Accepted with notification ID
    W->>D: Read due pending row
    D-->>W: Saved delivery intent
    W->>P: Send with stable channel key
    P-->>W: Acceptance or error
    W->>D: Save outcome or retry time
